# Direct cross-platform packaging tools at their latest stable compatible
# releases. `make lock` compiles the complete hash lock into
# requirements-package.txt. pip-compile evaluates platform markers on its Linux
# host. Keep the Windows console and PyInstaller dependencies explicit so this
# lock is installable there.

